# Manual review corrections for vol2-2-7-integrals-exponential-functions-and-logarithms.tex
#
# - Fixed a mathematical error introduced by mis-scoped braces: the
#   denominator of $\int_{2}^{e}\frac{dx}{{x\,(\ln x)}^{2}}$ squared the
#   whole product x*ln(x) instead of just (ln x), silently changing the
#   exercise from x*(ln x)^2 to (x*ln x)^2 = x^2*(ln x)^2. Corrected to
#   x\,{(\ln x)}^{2} so only (ln x) is squared, matching the standard
#   OpenStax exercise and its closed-form antiderivative -1/ln(x).
# - Joined fragmented math spans that fused prose ("to", "and") into a
#   single math span via \,\text{to}\, / \,\text{and}\, (e.g.
#   $x=1\,\text{to}\,x=2$), splitting them into separate math spans with
#   plain English between them, consistent with the correctly-formatted
#   instance already present a few lines below.
# - Typeset bare "x-axis" as "$x$-axis" and the bare prose "ln x" in the
#   accessibility figure description as $\ln x$, per math-mode conventions.
# - Fixed the typo "3-dimensinal" to "3-dimensional" in the same figure
#   description.
